26 11:15:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59741</s:story_id></item><item><title>No. 23 West Virginia Hosts American at Hope Coliseum</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/21/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-hosts-american-at-hope-coliseum</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/21/wrestling-no-23-west-virginia-hosts-american-at-hope-coliseum</guid><category>Wrestling</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team dominated Mercyhurst, 52-0, to open dual competition at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., on Saturday." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-54.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team faces American at Hope Coliseum in Morgantown at 1 p.m. on Sunday on ESPN+.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-54.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-54.jpg"><media:title>The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team dominated Mercyhurst, 52-0, to open dual competition at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., on Saturday.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/7/Wrestling_vsMercyhurst_atCameron_Nov7_2026_AM-54.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:59:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>18</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59740</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Set for Final Regular Season Road Match at Kansas State</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/21/volleyball-mountaineers-set-for-final-regular-season-road-match-at-kansas-state</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/21/volleyball-mountaineers-set-for-final-regular-season-road-match-at-kansas-state</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Lucie Smardova and Nina Horning high five after winning a point at Kansas on Nov. 20" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/21/DTB03887.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (13-12, 6-9 Big 12) wraps up its final road trip of the regular season on Sunday, Nov. 22, with a matchup against Kansas State at Morgan Family Arena in Manhattan, Kansas. First serve is set for 1 p.m. ET.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/21/DTB03887.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/21/DTB03887.jpg"><media:title>Lucie Smardova and Nina Horning high five after winning a point at Kansas on Nov. 20</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/21/DTB03887.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:28:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59739</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU Concludes Home Slate With Meeting Against 20th-Ranked Houston Today</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/21/football-wvu-concludes-home-slate-with-meeting-against-20th-ranked-houston-today</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/21/football-wvu-concludes-home-slate-with-meeting-against-20th-ranked-houston-today</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="A view of an empty Milan Puskar Stadium Press Box on its final day of usage before being demolished to make way for a new facility set to open in 2028." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/21/PressBox-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Two teams looking to rebound from disappointing performances last weekend will meet in Morgantown today when West Virginia plays host to 20th-ranked Houston.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/21/PressBox-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/21/PressBox-Main.jpg"><media:title>A view of an empty Milan Puskar Stadium Press Box on its final day of usage before being demolished to make way for a new facility set to open in 2028.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/21/PressBox-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59733</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>